; Federica Lombardi &lt;flombardi@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject: Re: Report&nbsp;Also, what is Celine's status at the moment - is she on gardening leave? I would assume we can't say that she &quot;has direct responsibility for&quot;&nbsp;It's fine to not comment on TG's responsibilities but do we need to say something about the firm's own responsibilities?&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Anna&nbsp;VargaPartner+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7890&nbsp;043&nbsp;699From:&nbsp;Craig Shuttleworth &lt;craig@kastlesolicitors.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;Thursday, October 30, 2025 4:28 PMTo:&nbsp;Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Matthew Getz &lt;Matthew.Getz@pallasllp.com&gt;; Craig Shuttleworth &lt;cshuttleworth@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Holly Hampton &lt;hhampton@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Federica Lombardi &lt;flombardi@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Report &nbsp;CAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.&nbsp;Help !!&nbsp;Who is advising us on this ? Either way I don’t like Para 3.&nbsp;Craig Shuttleworth07770 847435&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;From:&nbsp;Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;30 October 2025 16:25To:&nbsp;Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Craig Shuttleworth &lt;craig@kastlesolicitors.com&gt;; Matthew Getz &lt;Matthew.Getz@pallasllp.com&gt;; Craig Shuttleworth &lt;cshuttleworth@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Xenia Kalognomas &lt;Xenia.Kalognomas@pallasllp.com&gt;; Holly Hampton &lt;hhampton@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Federica Lombardi &lt;flombardi@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Plate Litigation &lt;plate_litigation@pallasllp.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Report&nbsp;Hi all,&nbsp;Clyde’s have reviewed the draft letter and have suggested a couple of refinements in the attached. &nbsp;They 