Morning Anna,

&nbsp;

Just following up on the below. With the good news that PG's application to resign as Lead Solicitor having been put on ice (pending further clarification from Pogust Goodhead
 or approval of the proposed agency relationship by the SRA), we need to consider the implications of this ruling.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

