 or whether they intend to seek SRA approval of the AA (again making clear the Case Leads concerns).&nbsp;

&nbsp;

We have also become aware of a letter from Slaughter and May regarding litigation conduct and that this may have in turn resulted in or precipitated resignations from others
 in the business. If there are such concerns that have been raised regarding litigation conduct in the firm, that we are all senior employees of, then we need to know and we need to know what the position of the firm is. In case it was not obvious, each of
